#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the Qiskit Runtime client so you can run jobs on IBM quantum "
"computers."
msgstr ""
"Installa il client Qiskit Runtime per poter eseguire job sui computer "
"quantistici IBM."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client"
msgstr "Installa il client Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Qiskit Runtime client {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-client}"
msgstr ""
"Installa il client Qiskit Runtime {#install-the-qiskit-runtime-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Runtime is the cloud-based service for executing quantum computations"
" on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to install `qiskit-"
"ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing the Qiskit Runtime "
"service.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Runtime è il servizio cloud per l'esecuzione di calcoli quantistici "
"sull'hardware IBM Quantum&reg;. Questa guida ti mostra come installare "
"`qiskit-ibm-runtime`, il pacchetto client per accedere al servizio Qiskit "
"Runtime.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before installing the Qiskit Runtime client, follow the instructions in "
"these guides:\n"
msgstr ""
"Prima di installare il client Qiskit Runtime, segui le istruzioni in queste "
"guide:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr "[Installa Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Configura il tuo account IBM Cloud](cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install Qiskit Runtime:\n"
msgstr "Esegui questo comando per installare Qiskit Runtime:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [Qiskit Runtime release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Resta aggiornato con le ultime versioni\">\n"
"Controlla periodicamente le [note di rilascio di Qiskit Runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) per vedere le nuove versioni. Ti consiglio di aggiornare frequentemente i requisiti per `qiskit-ibm-runtime` eseguendo `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Passi successivi {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Review the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Raccomandazioni\">\n"
"  - [Installa Qiskit SDK dal codice sorgente](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Esegui il tuo primo programma](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Prova un tutorial, come l'[algoritmo di Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Consulta la [politica di deprecazione](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
